Changes in this package: isolated convolution/selector reference equations,
explicit input validation, passive/lazy imports, bounded CPU tests, and an
AST oracle that removes only compiler decorators and static-shape annotations.
These are reference components; no learned checkpoint parameters are included.

Additional retained primitive sources at the same SGLang revision:
python/sglang/srt/layers/layernorm.py
python/sglang/srt/layers/rotary_embedding/base.py
python/sglang/srt/layers/rotary_embedding/utils.py
