The package also adapts their native/sequential arithmetic and the DFlash
decoder body. The attention tests retain attributed original TorchNative SDPA
excerpts; attention.py documents the separate TRT expanded-decode mask contract.
The original copyright and license notices remain in each retained source file.
The original worker source is retained as sources/sglang_dflash_worker_v2.py
from python/sglang/srt/speculative/dflash_worker_v2.py at the same revision.
proposal.py isolates its TP1 dense greedy candidate/selector path; no sampling,
compiled accelerator kernel or native verifier is supplied.

